  "description": "⭐<em>Don't just watch the film. </em><strong><em>Taste it.</em></strong><br>\r\n<em>A bespoke cinematic dining experience where iconic film moments come straight to your table as they appear on screen,&nbsp;course by delicious course.</em><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Highlights</strong><br>\r\n🎥 Don’t just watch the film… savour it!<br>\r\n🧛 Enjoy a multi-course menu inspired by the film Sinners (2025)<br>\r\n🍴 Dine in sync with iconic on-screen moments - buttery cornbread, pickled garlic margs and a mississippi mud pie<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>General Info</strong><br>\r\n📅 Date: October 2026<br>\r\n🕐 Time: Please check your booking for specific event times.<br>\r\n📍 Location: Parlour, Kensal Rise, NW10 5LG<br>\r\n👤 Age rating: this film is rated <a href=\"https://www.bbfc.co.uk/release/sinners-q29sbgvjdglvbjpwwc0xmdi0mdu0\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">15</a><br>\r\n♿ Accessibility: this venue is NOT wheelchair accessible<br>\r\n🍽️ The menu: to view the menu, please click <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1IittMUopi6zAnoTJ15emrIkpNwCS28du/view?usp=drive_link\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\r\n❓ Please consult the FAQs of this experience <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/e/2PACX-1vSp2K6XG_QIZ2Gg_zrZb2xW9_xXjZJUPTPFAstXgmSUJavlcRlINfSLSKiSYT1VBfylMThAsmy0Fqjs/pub\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><br>\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>Description</strong><br>\r\nSouthern hospitality says welcome a stranger in. We say, tread carefully.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nExpect Southern comfort food, homemade elixirs, smoky flavours and sexy vampires.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nOne unforgettable feast. Tick! Two Michael B. Jordans? We did what we could.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nStep into the world of Sinners with an immersive Halloween cinematic dining experience where every course arrives in perfect sync with the film. What starts as a night of music and Southern hospitality spirals into something far more sinister. As the story unfolds, so does your menu, with each dish carefully crafted to immerse you deeper into one of the most unforgettable cinematic experiences of the year.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nInspired by the Deep South, blues music and folklore, you'll feast your way through Delta-inspired street food, crispy catfish, buttery cornbread, homemade hoodoo, bourbon-laced desserts and a few surprises lurking in the shadows. It's everything you loved about the film, brought to life one course at a time.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nWhether you're coming for the food, the folklore, the soundtrack or... the vampires... this is the ultimate way to experience Sinners.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nCome hungry. Trust no one. And whatever you do... don't miss the cornbread.",
